### ====================================================================
### appointment-service - PostgreSQL / medflow_appointments
###
### Este servico CHAMA o patient-service. Observe no retorno o campo
### patientName (que veio da chamada remota) e patientDataConfirmed.
### ====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### Listar todas as consultas
GET {{gateway}}/api/appointments

### Consultas de um paciente
GET {{gateway}}/api/appointments?patientId=1

### Consultas de uma especialidade
GET {{gateway}}/api/appointments?specialty=Cardiologia

### Buscar por id
GET {{gateway}}/api/appointments/1

### Agendar uma consulta
### -> dispara a chamada HTTP appointment-service --> patient-service
POST {{gateway}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorName": "Dr. Helio Vasconcelos",
  "specialty": "Cardiologia",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-12-15T14:30:00",
  "notes": "Retorno para avaliacao de hipertensao"
}

### Confirmar a consulta
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/appointments/1/status?status=CONFIRMADA

### Marcar como realizada
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/appointments/1/status?status=REALIZADA

### Cancelar
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/appointments/1/cancel

### Reconciliar os agendamentos aceitos em modo degradado
### (roda depois que o patient-service volta ao ar)
POST {{gateway}}/api/appointments/reconcile

### ---- Casos de erro ----

### Paciente inexistente -> 422. O patient-service respondeu 404, portanto
### e falha de NEGOCIO: nao conta como falha para o Circuit Breaker.
POST {{gateway}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 999999,
  "doctorName": "Dr. Teste",
  "specialty": "Clinica Geral",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-12-20T09:00:00"
}

### Data no passado -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{gateway}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorName": "Dr. Teste",
  "specialty": "Clinica Geral",
  "scheduledAt": "2020-01-01T09:00:00"
}
